# Normalize line endings: the repo stores LF and must check out LF on every
# platform. Without this, Windows runners (core.autocrlf=true default) check
# out CRLF and `prettier --check` with endOfLine:"lf" fails on every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated / binary files that must never be renormalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.dump binary